OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fincreasingly wet this evening with
OL,7,Frain, quite heavy in places, moving
OL,8,Fsouth across the region, tending to
OL,9,Fturn more showery in the south.
OL,10,FStaying cloudy overnight, with
OL,11,Foccasional periods of rain and
OL,12,Fdrizzle, mostly light. Rather warm and
OL,13,Fhumid.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FBrightening up, after a
OL,16,Fcloudy and damp start, with sunny
OL,17,Fspells and a scattering of showers.
OL,18,FThe showers heaviest and most frequent
OL,19,Fin the north. Breezier and feeling
OL,20,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
